  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ambassadors&apos; Special Self Help Program (SSH)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small grants supporting a variety of community-identified self-help efforts that advance U.S. mission policies and objectives. Project costs range from $1,000 to $25,000. Examples include: borehole wells, water tanks and taps, pump houses, cisterns, latrines, showers, and food sheds.</narrative>
  </description>
